It specifies conformance vectors and a reference verifier for binding an
RFC 9421 (HTTP Message Signatures) signature key to an issued agent credential,
layered on the raw signature check provided by algovoi-rfc9421-verifier.

The Ed25519 keys in the vectors are throwaway test keys with published seeds.
They protect nothing and must never be used outside conformance testing.

